     the full modifier set. Do not soften a refutation if Sub-exp 3 returns (c). -->

At authorship, the arc stands at **PARTIALLY SUPPORTED — cloud generalization
only.** That is the honest ceiling the closed data supports, and it is a real
result: a fitness app's PM framework produced a falsifiable, pre-registered,
externally-auditable hardware hypothesis, and the first axis of it held and
strengthened under replication.

Two standing caveats travel with every claim above: (1) the strongest
interpretive claims are **T3 narrative over T1 data, scoped to 4 endpoints** —
the full 9-endpoint matrix (Sub-exp 1B) is queued; (2) the Phase 2-bis synthesis
verdict is **PENDING** and must not be read as closed.

The forward path: HADF Sub-exps 2 & 3 close the device-local and routing-layer
axes; External Audit #2 (2026-06-12) independently checks the raw data; and the
Orchid v2 spec stub — gated on the Chisel toolchain — turns whichever unit
decisions survive into RTL intent. Track R waits; the evidence does not.

